    <div class="mt-6 prose prose-lg max-w-3xl">
      <p>beehiiv and Kit score 1 on price because their networks need a paid plan, which you may already pay for. This site is maintained by the team behind <a href={siteConfig.product.ctaUrl}>{siteConfig.product.name}</a>, which finds the brands already sponsoring newsletters in a niche and pitches them for the newsletter's owner. Sponsor Radar is operated by Sales.co. It is scored here with the same three criteria as every other option, using its own company page and llms.txt.</p>

      <h2>The ranking at a glance</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[760px] text-left border-collapse text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b-2 border-gray-300 align-bottom">
            <th class="py-3 pr-3 font-semibold text-gray-600 whitespace-nowrap">Rank and score</th>
            <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-semibold text-gray-600">Option and channels</th>
            <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-semibold text-gray-600">Selling done for you</th>
            <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-semibold text-gray-600">Price and fees as published</th>
            <th class="py-3 font-semibold text-gray-600">Who can use it</th>
          </tr>
