      <h2>Free newsletter sponsor data from Sponsor Radar</h2>

      <p>Three free pages answer the questions that come before choosing a platform:</p>

      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://sponsorradar.co/newsletter-sponsors/this-week">Newsletter sponsors this week</a> lists the brands that ran newsletter ads in the last 7 days, ranked and by niche, rebuilt daily.</li>
        <li><a href="https://sponsorradar.co/newsletter-sponsorship-rates">Newsletter sponsorship rates</a> shows what newsletters list for a sponsorship, by list size, from their own advertise pages.</li>
        <li><a href="https://sponsorradar.co/sponsors">Sponsor profiles</a> has one page per brand seen sponsoring several newsletters, with the newsletters, niches, last ad and the brands that buy alongside it.</li>
      </ul>

