      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500">See also: <a href="/blog/find-sponsorship-opportunities-guide/" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">how to find sponsorship opportunities</a>, <a href="/blog/how-much-to-charge-for-sponsorship/" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">how much to charge for a sponsorship</a> and <a href="/tools/sponsorship-rate-calculator/" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">the sponsorship rate calculator</a>. Corrections: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.email}`} class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">{siteConfig.contact.email}</a>.</p>
